<title>USA: Oryx obtains $5.0 mln credit facility.</title>
<headline>Oryx obtains $5.0 mln credit facility.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oryx Technology Corp on Friday said it has obtained a $5.0 million credit faciility secured by accounts receivable and inventory.</p>
<p>&quot;This capital will enable us to execute a comprehensive strategy to lead the company back to profitability and maximize shareholder value,&quot; Philip Micciche, chief executive officer, said in a statement.</p>
<p>Oryx is a technology management company with products in surge protection, power supplies and specialized materials and materials analysis.</p>
